            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedo kumeno, nia, yo ng’ei lembe maeni ma Yehova yero ni Yob, Yehova wacu ni Elifaz ma Jatemani kumae, Kwinyo para opo i kumi, man kum jurimbi ario; kum wuyero gin m’atira ngo pira, calu jatic para ma Yob uyero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno kawono, wugam thwoni dhiang’ abiro iwu man nyogi rombe abiro, man wucidh ba jatic para ma Yob, man wuthier lam m’awang’a piwu giwu; man jatic para ma Yob bikwayu piwu; kum abiyio en, kara kud atim i kumwu calku kasegu mu; kum wuyero pira gin m’atira ngo, calu jatic para ma Yob uyero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Elifaz ma Jatemani man Bildad ma Jacuhi man Zofar ma Janamathi gicidho, man gitimo calu Yehova ng’olo igi: e Yehova jolo Yob. Yehova Dwoko Mierolembe pa Yob ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.1.1+JOB.1.2+JOB.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 1:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova loko ng’eca pa Yob, kinde m’erwo pi jurimbe: man Yehova mio yau piny ma yang’ Yob ubedo ko wang’ ario ire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utumin mire ceke gilund gibino i bang’e, man nyimin mire ceke, ku dhanu ceke ma naka gibedo i lela pare, man gicamu kwen karacelo kude i ot pare: e giywage, man gijuke kum lem ma rac ceke ma Yehova kelo i wie: man ku ba dhanu ceke bende ng’atuman umio ire ng’et mola ma tar man ku ba dhanu ceke ng’atu man lagith mi mola ma kwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yehova mio mugisa wi kajik pa Yob ma sagu thekrine: man ebedo ku rombe rubanga apar wi ang’wen, man ngamia rubanga abusiel, man mberembere mi koni dhiang’ rubanga acel, man mege kana rubanga acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebedo ku wote abiro bende man nyige adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man elwong’o nying’ ma kwong’ane Yemima; man nying’ mir arionde ke Kezia; man nying’ mir adege ke Kerenhapuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ng’om ceke mon moko mbe ma junwang’u wang’gi leng’ calu nyig Yob: man weggi mio igi aba i kind uturneggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man yo ng’ei maeni Yob ucamu ng’om rundi dak acel ku pier ang’wen, man eneno wote, ku wot wote, en e dhanum’utuk ang’wen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yob utho, m’eti m’epong’ kuceng’ de.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
